SUMMARY:Blacktop Saturday-Reuben's Challenge (42M)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Come out an work off th
 e calories from Thursday.**\n**Possible lunch at Boniface afterwards.**\n\
 n**Ride leader: Dave Stauffer**\n**Ride sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)**\n**
 Anticipated Average Pace: 12-14 mph**\n\n**Other ride leaders requested fo
 r other paces.**\n\n**Route:** [Reuben's Challenge (42M)](https://routes.l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/route/ec-reubens-challenge/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\
 , and Ride Together**\n\n**The ride leader will ride at the advertised ave
 rage speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the
  main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group togethe
 r with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to ali
 gn to pace capabilities.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please 
 bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 in
 flator).**\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we requ
 ire LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on 
 Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here** [Member Signup](ht
 tps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n*
 *Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct:** [Co
 de of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&c
 lub_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n**Guidance if an incident occurs:** [Inci
 dent Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3174819
 52/
