SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU:  CoffedTue LI - Speedwell Forge Loop (24H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader: Bruce Blac
 k**\nThis is a ride starting at the Lititz library heading north around Sp
 eedwell Forge and then out toward Manheim before returning to Lititz to ha
 ve a coffee and snack at New Holland Coffee shop. The expected pace is 14 
 to 16 mph with multiple re-group points.\n\nCue and GPX link: [https://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/49990180](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49990180)\n\n
 Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair k
 it (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing a
 round a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup R
 SVP below to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club
  member.\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's:\n[Join the C
 lub](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257
 148)\n[Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?
 page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n[Rules of the Road](https://l
 ancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_
 id=325159)\n[Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=76352
 3)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3176082
 13/
