SUMMARY:Jigger Shop Trail Ride 24miles F RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nWeather permitting. Pleas
 e check Meet Up on the day of this ride. RSVP Required. The world famous J
 igger Shop is opening three weekends in December…\nJoin members and frie
 nds of the Wilmington and Lancaster club on a trail ride to the world famo
 us Jigger Shop. Sunday\, December 13th ride begins at 1:30 pm from the fam
 ous Root Beer Barrel\, route 419 in Cornwall. We will ride the Lebanon Val
 ley trail 10 miles toward Elizabethtown\, turning around and riding back. 
 On our way back\, we will stop in Mt. Gretna at the popular Jigger shop fo
 r ice cream/ and or yummy food. Helmets are required\; have a tube so some
 one can fix a flat. Hybrid or Gravel bike recommended. Richard Conner\, le
 ader 717-572-8480\n\nThis is a casual ride. Please do not sign up for this
  ride unless you are willing to ride at a casual pace and stay with the gr
 oup. No one left behind.\nHelmets are mandatory\;\nPlease do not put the l
 eader in an embarrassing situation having to beg someone to wear a helmet\
 nPlease bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, p
 ump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, w
 e encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. R
 SVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not 
 RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; on
 ly club members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you ar
 e a club member. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the 
 club's Code of Conduct: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpr
 ess.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nRules of
  the Road: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&c
 lub_id=257148&module_id=325159](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) and\nRide Waiver: [htt
 ps://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=763523](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/docs.ashx?id=763523)
